 OC MIMIMAP.\nMake another box come in from below written: Skeleton Song, and below it: Midnight and Peony.\nScene: Forest (Day)\nShow Midnight looking luckily on a peony. \nPeony coming in. Midnight looking up. \n\n- Part 2 -\nScene: Forest (Day)\nShow Peony lipsync.\nMidnight looking quite emberrased. Him blush. \nPeony smiling warmly. \n\n- Part 3 -\nScene: Forest (Day)\nPeony lipsync, and jumping forwards. \nHim walking luckily through the forest.\nMidnight looking slightly happy at him, hesitating, then following. \n\n- Part 4 -\nPeony turning around and him lipsync happily\nMidnight's gaze turning scared and slightly sad, him lipsync. \nPeony reaching his paw to him and Midnight looking up, less sad. \n\n- Part 5 -\nPeony lipsync and laughing warmly\nMidnight smiling. \nScene: Transition to night (forest)\nHim turning around to see the bl00d moon. \nMidnight crouching of pain. \n\n- Part 6 -\nScene: Forest (Night)\nMidnight becoming Midnight Monster, but for a moment his eyes shining only red and red glow around him. \nHis wings spread and the moon behind him. \nHim standing again on all four legs, but holding his one paw up to see his claws. Gaze turning very scared. \nMidnight looking up. \nShowing Peony looking scared and confused. \nShowing both of them standing with a distance. Peony's fur bristling. \n\n- Part 7 -\nScene: Forest (Night)\nShowing Peony's paws stepping backwards. \nMidnight looking scared. \nPeony's gaze turning more disappointed and cold while some tears slip down his cheeks. \n\n- Part 8 -\nScene: Night (Forest)\nPeony turning around and walking away, leaving Midnight Monster alone. \nShowing Midnight surprised and sad, with tears. \n\n- Outro -\nScene: Forest (Night)\nShowing Midnight lipsync with tears escaping his eyes. \nFrom a distance, showing him sitting down and covering himself with his wings.  "}},"currentCostume":7,"costumes":[{"name":"costume1","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"0e7e2486a6e70c36718566bd6cb5618